/* ==========================================================================
   nomimatcha: the matcha catalog. ONE place for the six matchas.
   Every page that lists matcha (search, cart, shop, product, home...) reads from here.

   Source of truth for the content = the client's corrections PDF (Nov 2026).
   Rules:
   - What the client wrote wins over what we wrote earlier.
   - A yellow "Enter ..." note (see NMCAT.TODO) = the client has not given it yet. Replace the value in this file when they do.
   - sample:true = a value that is OUR placeholder, kept only until the client replies.
   - kj = the short kanji the site shows (the name without の昔 / の白); kjFull = as printed on the packaging stamp.
     Only 瑞鳳 and 龍雲 are the same in both. Chiyogi 千代木の昔 and Soho 小峰の白 are still the short form here.

   Scores are stored exactly as the client wrote them ('5+', '5++', '0'), see NMCAT.num().
   ========================================================================== */
